# 0229 = 0228 isolation slot: acm_ep0_rx.state/buf private to ACM.
#   SET_LINE_CODING arms EP0_STATE_WAIT_LINE_CODING only (no FIFO touch).
#   ruby_ep0_service EP0_RXPKTRDY intercepts before cmd_consume/TX drain,
#   consumes 7B into the private slot, RX ACK (RXPKTRDY|DATAEND), return.
